    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evelyn inherited the small cocktail bar\u2018Hyacinth Bar' in her hometown according to her grandfather\u2019s will. However, she is not easy to running a store, becuse she knows nothing about cocktail bars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At that time, five men appeared in front of her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With their help, evelyn becomes increasingly interested in alcohol, studies cocktails, and becomes skilled at running a bar. But these guys seem to be crossing a line too far when it comes to helping develop cocktail menus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developing new menus, increasing sales, an unexpected love line, a turbulent story unfolds before Evelyn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Liquor Love Lady' is a visual novel-based game with minigame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game where the goal is to run a store, develop a new menu, and compete in a cocktail contest with the man with the most affinity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy the fun of the tycoon game through a mini game where you open a bar, make and sell cocktails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The money earned from running a bar, you can purchase character event scenarios to increase he's favorability or develop new cocktail menus. Or you can upgrade your store to earn more money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, you can participate in a cocktail contest with most favorability character.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evelyn inherited the small cocktail bar\u2018Hyacinth Bar' in her hometown according to her grandfather\u2019s will. However, she is not easy to running a store, becuse she knows nothing about cocktail bars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At that time, five men appeared in front of her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With their help, evelyn becomes increasingly interested in alcohol, studies cocktails, and becomes skilled at running a bar. But these guys seem to be crossing a line too far when it comes to helping develop cocktail menus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developing new menus, increasing sales, an unexpected love line, a turbulent story unfolds before Evelyn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Liquor Love Lady' is a visual novel-based game with minigame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game where the goal is to run a store, develop a new menu, and compete in a cocktail contest with the man with the most affinity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy the fun of the tycoon game through a mini game where you open a bar, make and sell cocktails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The money earned from running a bar, you can purchase character event scenarios to increase he's favorability or develop new cocktail menus. Or you can upgrade your store to earn more money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, you can participate in a cocktail contest with most favorability character.</p>",
